WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.404
Hello! Who are you?

2
00:00:09.405 --> 00:00:13.442
I'm a great horned owl.

3
00:00:13.443 --> 00:00:16.713
We are raptors.

4
00:00:16.714 --> 00:00:21.134
Raptors are birds that hunt.

5
00:00:21.135 --> 00:00:23.819
Where do you live?

6
00:00:23.820 --> 00:00:29.032
Great horned owls live in many places.

7
00:00:29.033 --> 00:00:35.337
We like forests, tundra, and even cities.

8
00:00:35.338 --> 00:00:39.351
We often make nests in tree holes.

9
00:00:39.352 --> 00:00:41.758
How do you hunt?

10
00:00:41.759 --> 00:00:47.621
We can fly without making a sound.

11
00:00:47.622 --> 00:00:52.659
Our eyes help us see in the dark.

12
00:00:52.660 --> 00:00:57.892
I see your sharp claws!

13
00:00:57.893 --> 00:01:03.196
We use our sharp claws to kill prey.

14
00:01:03.197 --> 00:01:08.963
Our claws help us carry food too.

15
00:01:08.964 --> 00:01:12.890
What do you eat?

16
00:01:12.891 --> 00:01:19.902
We eat mice, raccoons, and sometimes skunks.

17
00:01:19.903 --> 00:01:24.184
We swallow our prey whole.

18
00:01:24.185 --> 00:01:28.774
Then we spit up the bones and fur.

19
00:01:28.775 --> 00:01:32.684
Are those horns on your head?

20
00:01:32.685 --> 00:01:38.083
No, they are just tall feathers.

21
00:01:38.084 --> 00:01:42.511
But these feathers look like horns!

22
00:01:42.512 --> 00:01:45.768
Do you have any enemies?

23
00:01:45.769 --> 00:01:52.337
Sometimes crows gather around us.

24
00:01:52.338 --> 00:01:57.370
They caw loudly and chase us.

25
00:01:57.371 --> 00:02:02.108
It's getting dark—time to hunt!

26
00:02:02.109 --> 00:02:05.769
Hoo-hoo-hoo!

27
00:02:05.770 --> 00:02:14.016
Good-bye, Great Horned Owl!

